+````markdown name=ops/backup/backup_playbook.md
+```text
+Aegis Production Backup & Restore Playbook (core services)
+
+Scope:
+ - Milvus (data + meta)
+ - MLflow artifacts (S3/GCS) and backend DB (Postgres)
+ - Redis (RDB/AOF)
+ - Prometheus long-term storage (snapshots)
+ - Grafana dashboards & provisioning (export)
+
+Daily backups:
+ - Milvus: schedule snapshot script to export collections to object store (S3/GCS) and verify checksums.
+ - Postgres (MLflow backend): scheduled logical backups (pg_dump) and WAL shipping for PITR.
+ - Redis: periodic RDB snapshot and AOF persistence to object store.
+ - Prometheus: enable remote_write to long-term store or schedule tsdb snapshots.
+ - Grafana: export dashboards via API and store JSON in evidence bucket.
+
+Restore exercise:
+ - Test restores monthly in staging: restore Milvus collection from snapshot, restore Postgres dump, import Grafana dashboards, restore Redis snapshot.
+
+Security:
+ - Backup artifacts must be written to WORM or versioned object storage and checksummed.
+ - Use encryption at rest & in transit for backups. Limit access to backup artifacts to security & SRE roles.
+
+Automation:
+ - Use Kubernetes CronJobs, Argo Workflows or external scheduler to run backup tasks; verify via CI job that restores succeed.
+
+Example tools:
+ - Milvus: milvusctl export/import or python client scripts
+ - Postgres: pg_dump / pg_restore
+ - Redis: redis-cli --rdb / s3 sync
+ - Grafana: grafana-cli or API export
+````

