+"""
+Collector for human labels:
+ - Ingests escalations (GitHub issue IDs or remediation tracker entries) and fetches the response + context
+ - Writes a labeling dataset with fields: id, query, response, hits (evidence snippets), label (human: supported/hallucination), annotator, ts
